## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a modular, auditable routing layer for prompts with data-sensitivity and reproducibility concerns. It emphasizes concrete signals, edge-case handling, and a small prototype to demonstrate flow control.

## Key Concepts

- Prompt routing signals: intent, data_sensitivity, reproducibility
- Edge-case handling: ambiguity, missing sources, conflicting data
- Lightweight prototyping: minimal module map and payload schema

## Code Example

```javascript
function routePrompt(prompt) {
  const text = prompt.toLowerCase()
  const toLiterature = /(summarize|literature|research)/.test(text)
  const toExperiment = /(experiment|plan|propose)/.test(text)
  const needsAudit = /(audit|trace|reproducible)/.test(text)

  if (toLiterature && toExperiment && needsAudit) {
    return {
      modules: ['Literature-Summary', 'Experiment-Plan', 'Audit-Log-Formatter'],
      payload: { prompt, sources: [], trace: { confidence: 0.8 } }
    }
  }
  // Additional routing logic...
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a modular, latency-aware prompt routing flow in an edge/cloud context. It requires turning a user goal into a module selection, a concise execution plan, and a concrete payload while considering safety and edge cases.

## Key Concepts
- Prompt routing and modular design
- PII redaction and latency constraints
- Edge-case handling and fallbacks

## Code Example
```javascript
// Tiny router sketch
function routePrompt(req){
  const intent = req.intent||'';
  const data = req.data_sensitivity||'';
  const latency = req.latency_budget||Infinity;
  if(intent.includes('summary') && data==='PII' && latency<=1000){
    return {module:'Summary-Builder', plan:['fetch','redact','summarize'], payload:{regions:req.regions||['us-east','us-west'], redact:true}};
  }
  return {module:'Data-Extractor', plan:['extract'], payload:{}};
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you test this for latency budgets and safety guards?
- How would you extend to handle parallel modules and partial results?

